    'Write a journal entry': 'Tulis entri jurnal',
    'Chain buses, trains, boats and flights across Thailand, Laos, Cambodia and Vietnam — including overland border crossings. Times and fares are guidance and work offline.': 'Rangkai bus, kereta, perahu, dan penerbangan di Thailand, Laos, Kamboja, dan Vietnam, termasuk perlintasan perbatasan darat. Jam dan tarif adalah panduan dan berfungsi luring.',
